2. One registered `lstm` run and one registered `attention` run in that project, with their `run_artifacts` rows (the default `SEQSIGHT_IT_ARTIFACT_SOURCE=supabase` downloads them exactly as Render does). Their `runs.test_mae_c` must be real measured values: register them with `scripts/register_forecast_runs.py` and the real `test_eval.json`; never insert fabricated metrics. Alternatively set `SEQSIGHT_IT_ARTIFACT_SOURCE=local` plus `SEQSIGHT_IT_LSTM_ARTIFACT` / `SEQSIGHT_IT_ATTENTION_ARTIFACT` paths to the local `.pt` files whose hashes are recorded on those runs.
